## ShoppingCart PHP Class

Here's a well-structured `ShoppingCart` class with comprehensive functionality:

```php
<?php

class ShoppingCart
{
    private array $items = [];

    /**
     * Add an item to the cart.
     * If the item already exists, its quantity is incremented.
     *
     * @param string $id       Unique identifier for the item
     * @param string $name     Display name of the item
     * @param float  $price    Price per unit
     * @param int    $quantity Number of units to add (default: 1)
     *
     * @throws InvalidArgumentException If price or quantity is invalid
     */
    public function addItem(string $id, string $name, float $price, int $quantity = 1): void
    {
        if ($price < 0) {
            throw new InvalidArgumentException("Price cannot be negative.");
        }

        if ($quantity <= 0) {
            throw new InvalidArgumentException("Quantity must be greater than zero.");
        }

        if (isset($this->items[$id])) {
            $this->items[$id]['quantity'] += $quantity;
        } else {
            $this->items[$id] = [
                'name'     => $name,
                'price'    => $price,
                'quantity' => $quantity,
            ];
        }
    }

    /**
     * Remove an item from the cart by its ID.
     * Decrements quantity if $quantity is specified; removes entirely if not.
     *
     * @param string   $id       Unique identifier of the item to remove
     * @param int|null $quantity Number of units to remove (null = remove all)
     *
     * @throws InvalidArgumentException If the item is not found or quantity is invalid
     */
    public function removeItem(string $id, ?int $quantity = null): void
    {
        if (!isset($this->items[$id])) {
            throw new InvalidArgumentException("Item with ID '{$id}' not found in cart.");
        }

        if ($quantity === null) {
            unset($this->items[$id]);
            return;
        }

        if ($quantity <= 0) {
            throw new InvalidArgumentException("Quantity to remove must be greater than zero.");
        }

        if ($quantity >= $this->items[$id]['quantity']) {
            unset($this->items[$id]);
        } else {
            $this->items[$id]['quantity'] -= $quantity;
        }
    }

    /**
     * Get the total cost of all items in the cart.
     *
     * @return float Total price rounded to 2 decimal places
     */
    public function getTotal(): float
    {
        $total = 0.0;

        foreach ($this->items as $item) {
            $total += $item['price'] * $item['quantity'];
        }

        return round($total, 2);
    }

    /**
     * Get all items currently in the cart.
     *
     * @return array Associative array of cart items
