## Key Design Decisions

| Feature | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Item storage** | Keyed by ID for O(1) lookup and automatic deduplication |
| **Quantity merging** | Adding an existing item increments quantity instead of duplicating |
| **Partial removal** | `removeItem($id, $qty)` decrements; `removeItem($id)` removes entirely |
| **Input validation** | Throws `InvalidArgumentException` for bad inputs |
| **Precision** | `round(..., 2)` prevents floating-point drift in totals |

## ShoppingCart PHP Class

```php
