## Key Design Decisions

| Feature | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Item storage** | Keyed by product ID for O(1) lookups |
| **Duplicate handling** | Adding an existing ID increments quantity |
| **Partial removal** | `removeItem($id, $qty)` reduces quantity instead of deleting |
| **Input validation** | Throws `InvalidArgumentException` for bad inputs |
