## Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Reason |
|---|---|
| `$id` as array key | O(1) lookups and prevents duplicate entries |
| Optional `$quantity` in `removeItem` | Flexible — reduce stock or remove entirely |
| `array_reduce` for total | Functional, concise, and avoids mutation |
| Exceptions on bad input | Fail fast with clear, descriptive error messages |
| `getItemCount` vs `count($items)` | Distinguishes unique products from total units |

