## Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Reason |
|---|---|
| **Keyed by ID** | Allows O(1) lookups and prevents accidental duplicates |
| **Optional quantity on remove** | Flexible — remove one unit or the whole line item |
| **`round($total, 2)`** | Avoids floating-point precision issues in monetary output |
| **Exceptions on bad input** | Fails loudly rather than silently corrupting cart state |
| **Private `$items` array** | Encapsulates state; external code uses the public API |

