## Key Design Decisions

| Feature | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Item storage** | Keyed by product ID — prevents duplicates and allows O(1) lookup |
| **Partial removal** | Pass a quantity to `removeItem()` to reduce, or omit it to remove entirely |
