## Key Design Decisions

| Feature | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Fluent interface** | All mutating methods return `$this` for method chaining |
| **Duplicate handling** | Adding the same SKU stacks quantity instead of overwriting |
| **Partial removal** | `removeItem($id, $qty)` reduces quantity; `null` removes entirely |
| **Input validation** | Negative prices/quantities throw `InvalidArgumentException` |
| **Floating-point safety** | All money values use `round(..., 2)` to avoid drift |
| **Separation of concerns** | `CartItem` owns per-item logic; `ShoppingCart` owns collection logic |

